error_signature: "cannot find -l(curl|nettle|json-c|uv)|No such file or directory.*lib(curl|nettle|json-c|uv)\\.a|undefined reference to `curl_|skipping incompatible"
root_cause: "上游 Makefile.am 硬编码 -static 整体静态链接时，失败面通常不在 OHOS 工具链（llvm 15.0.4/ohos-sdk 26.0.0.18 实测 clang -static 可产出可运行的 ELF EXEC，静态 musl + libclang_rt 齐备），而在 conan 依赖制品是否带 .a——ohpcd 远程 libcurl/8.5.0 的 p/lib 只有 .so，静态模式 -lcurl 必失败；各依赖归档形态不一（nettle/libmicrohttpd 仅 .a，libuv/json-c 双形态）。"
rec_approach: "三步判读序：①clang -static hello 探针取证工具链能力；②逐依赖 ls package_folder/lib/*.a 查归档；③任一依赖只有 .so 时只删上游 -static（补丁），库本体仍 R26 静态优先，不为凑 -static 改依赖 shared 选项触发闭包源码重编。"
match_keywords: ["-static", "cannot find -l", "libcurl.a", "shared-only", "ELF EXEC", "R26", "ohos", "libtool"]
error_excerpt: "clang-15: error: linker command failed (static mode: cannot find -lcurl; probe: clang -static hello.c -> ELF executable, 64-bit LSB arm64, static, runs rc=0)"
severity: P3
category: linking
last_updated: 2026-09-21
